		{
			description: ["&6&l穿过传送门，你的目光被脚下的一本&7&kI&f破旧日志&r吸引。捡起它，你意识到这是解开&4&l下界&r秘密的关键。遵循其中&7&kI&f古老的指引&r，忍受灼热，探索像&8&l黑曜石&r、&7&l下界石英&r和&8&l灵魂沙&r这样的稀有资源。但请注意：这个火热的地下世界栖息着&7&kI&f危险的生物&r，它们会在每个转角考验你的勇气与技巧。"]
			id: "60A401EE88E33C0C"
			rewards: [
				{
					command: "/give @p written_book{pages:['[\"\",{\"text\":\"Day 1, Year \",\"bold\":true,\"italic\":true,\"color\":\"#VAR(--TW-PROSE-BOLD)\"},{\"text\":\"???\",\"bold\":true,\"italic\":true,\"obfuscated\":true,\"color\":\"#VAR(--TW-PROSE-BOLD)\"},{\"text\":\"\\\\n\\\\nI have arrived in a realm of fire and brimstone, a place the ancients called the Nether. My first steps are cautious, the heat is almost unbearable. I\\'ve set up a rudimentary camp near the portal, my lifeline back to the Overworld.\",\"color\":\"reset\",\"italic\":true}]'],title:\"Tattered Journal\",author:SurrealNirvana}"
