		{
			dependencies: ["3062CA4B11B650AB"]
			description: [
				"&6&o翻阅&k日志&r&6&o的页面时，我看到了一位勇敢冒险者击败强大而可怕的&4&l&k凋零&r&6&o的详细记录。作者描述了收集必要资源、为即将到来的激烈战斗做准备的艰辛旅程。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&k日志&r&6&o警告了&4&l凋零&r&6&o的致命攻击，包括其爆炸性投射物和能迅速消耗生命值的&8&l&o凋零效果&r&6&o。作者血的教训告诉他，必须做好充分准备，配备合适的&6&l武器&r&6&o和&2&l药水&r&6&o，才有机会对抗&4&l凋零&r&6&o的强大力量。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"作者还包含了击败&4&l&k凋零&r&6&o的技巧和策略，例如建造封闭竞技场限制其移动，并利用环境优势。阅读&k日志&r&6&o的详细记录，我不禁对冒险者的勇敢和机智感到钦佩。"
			]
			id: "7599EFFB7DE28BFA"
			rewards: [
				{
					command: "/give @p written_book{pages:['[\"\",{\"text\":\"Day 20, Year \",\"bold\":true,\"italic\":true,\"color\":\"#VAR(--TW-PROSE-BOLD)\"},{\"text\":\"???\",\"bold\":true,\"italic\":true,\"obfuscated\":true,\"color\":\"#VAR(--TW-PROSE-BOLD)\"},{\"text\":\"\\\\n\\\\nI\\'ve assembled the Wither Skeleton skulls and soul sand in a specific pattern today. The result was terrifying, a creature known as the Wither. It\\'s a formidable foe, but I\\'ve managed to defeat it, gaining a Nether Star in the process.\",\"color\":\"reset\",\"italic\":true}]'],title:\"Tattered Journal 6\",author:SurrealNirvana}"
