		{
			dependencies: ["1D00918EF5E04B8D"]
			description: [
				"&7&o我继续阅读着这本破旧的&7&kI&f日志&r&o，目光落在一页描述着建造&6&l&7&kI&f信标&r&o及其解锁全部力量的复杂过程的页面上。这本&7&kI&f日志&r&o详细说明了建造&6&l&7&kI&f信标&r&o所需的资源，从普通的&f&l铁锭&r到珍贵的&2&l绿宝石块&r，还提供了寻找它们的最佳地点。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"收集资源后，玩家必须穿越险恶地形、抵御敌对生物，建造&6&l&7&kI&f信标&r&o。但旅程并未结束。根据&7&kI&f日志&r&o，&6&l&7&kI&f信标&r&o有多层结构，必须激活才能解锁全部威力并获得梦寐以求的&6&l信标建造师&r成就。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"每个层级都需要独特的资源，并为玩家带来新的挑战。从击败危险的守护者到穿越险恶的地形，&7&kI&f日志&r&o提供了克服障碍、解锁&6&l&7&kI&f信标&r&o全部潜力的宝贵提示。"
				""
				"读完这篇日志，我充满了兴奋和决心，要踏上这段史诗般的旅程，成为真正的&6&l&7&kI&fBeacon&r建造大师。"
			]
			id: "460F67FFF309F716"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 6
					id: "305BF08F0C329286"
					item: "minecraft:netherite_ingot"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					command: "/give @p written_book{pages:['[\"\",{\"text\":\"Day \",\"bold\":true,\"italic\":true,\"color\":\"#VAR(--TW-PROSE-BOLD)\"},{\"text\":\"???\",\"bold\":true,\"italic\":true,\"obfuscated\":true,\"color\":\"#VAR(--TW-PROSE-BOLD)\"},{\"text\":\", Year \",\"color\":\"#VAR(--TW-PROSE-BOLD)\",\"bold\":true,\"italic\":true},{\"text\":\"???\",\"bold\":true,\"italic\":true,\"obfuscated\":true,\"color\":\"#VAR(--TW-PROSE-BOLD)\"},{\"text\":\"\\\\n\\\\nToday, the Nether shook with a fury I\\'ve never seen before. The sky, usually a constant blaze, darkened as a massive creature, a Wither of unimaginable size, emerged from the depths..\",\"color\":\"reset\",\"italic\":true}]','{\"text\":\"Its roar echoed through the realm, and with each beat of its wings, portals shattered, their magic extinguished.\\\\n\\\\nIn the face of this cataclysm, I\\'ve made a decision.\",\"italic\":true}','{\"text\":\"I\\'ve used the last of my strength to cast an enchantment on this journal. It will appear before the next traveler who dares to step foot in the Nether, serving as a guide, a beacon of knowledge in this realm of despair.\",\"italic\":true}','{\"text\":\"As I pen these final words, the Wither draws near. I can only hope that my sacrifice will not be in vain, that this journal will aid you in ways I can only imagine. May your journey through the Nether be more fortunate than mine. May you succeed where I have failed.\",\"italic\":true}'],title:\"Tattered Journal Final\",author:SurrealNirvana}"
